    {
      "id": "login-provider-catalogue",
      "reason": "Pi completes /login over a 43-entry provider/auth catalogue with per-provider oauth subscription metadata. PiSharp implements the same dedupe, ordering and insertion over its narrower registered provider surface; full catalogue parity is provider-breadth work outside this milestone.",
